-Leakage controls were applied before model training to ensure that each contaminant classifier used only predictors available under the specified analytical tier and did not include the target variable itself or chemically target-derived quantities. SAR, sodium adsorption ratio; TDS, total dissolved solids; EC, electrical conductivity. A dash indicates that the retained-feature count was not reported in the exported summary table.
