-Figure 3. PR-AUC performance heatmap for leakage-controlled groundwater exceedance models across predictor tiers. Heatmap values show precision--recall area under the curve (PR-AUC) for five groundwater-quality exceedance targets under three predictor designs: Tier 1 field variables, Tier 2 reduced hydrochemical variables, and Tier 3 full predictor variables. Rows represent target parameters, columns represent algorithms, and colours indicate predictive performance from low PR-AUC values in blue--green to high values in yellow--red. Sodium, chloride, and TDS show consistently high predictive performance, whereas fluoride and boron show more moderate and tier-dependent model performance.
